  50:../libs/PoliTeKDSP/libs/DaisySP/Source/Filters/ladder.h **** /**
  51:../libs/PoliTeKDSP/libs/DaisySP/Source/Filters/ladder.h ****  * 4-pole ladder filter model with selectable filter type (LP/BP/HP 12 or 24 dB/oct),
